  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Performance powerhouse! Optimise your daily run with the Nike Vomero 18. Featuring a new dual-density midsole with ZoomX foam stacked on top of ReactX foam for a comfortable ride, these upgraded shoes let you push boundaries and run beyond limits. The engineered mesh upper keeps you feeling soft and cool with every giant leap, while the plush tongue and lining wrap your feet in added snugness. Offering maximum cushioning and comfort, the Nike Vomero 18 ensures your every stride is a step towards running greatness.</p> <ul> <li>Pods around the outsole enhance agility and smoother heel-to-toe transitions.</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10 mm.</li> <li>Weight: 9.2 oz.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long walks, recovery miles, and everyday runs feel easier in the Nike Vomero 18. Built for a soft, protected ride, this women's road runner pairs an engineered mesh upper with plush padding and a dual-density midsole that stacks ZoomX foam over ReactX foam for maximum comfort from the first step to the last.</p><ul><li>Dual-density ZoomX and ReactX cushioning delivers a soft, responsive feel.</li><li>Engineered mesh upper helps keep the fit breathable.</li><li>Plush tongue and lining add step-in softness.</li><li>Outsole pods help create smoother heel-to-toe transitions.</li><li>10 mm heel-to-toe drop; approx. 9.2 oz.</li></ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size, with a secure feel and comfortable room through the toe box. For the best fit, we recommend choosing your usual size, or going up a half size if you prefer extra toe room for walking, training, or longer runs.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for runners and walkers who want maximum cushioning for daily miles, treadmill sessions, long shifts, and all-day comfort.</p> <p><strong>Cushioning & Road Feel</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently describe the ride as cloud-like, bouncy, and easy on feet, heels, and knees. The high-cushion platform helps soften road impact while keeping transitions smooth and comfortable.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p><p>Most buyers say comfort is immediate, with little to no break-in needed. Several longtime Vomero wearers and frequent runners also note that the shoe holds up well for regular walking, training, and repeated miles.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero 18 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>HM6804-104</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">